WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,240
Zhang Yi, why do you swallow so much food at home?

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:05,240
Is it true that one pound was too much for us last time?

3
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:07,240
You swallowed the chicken in advance

4
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:09,760
I'm too lazy to turn on the fire and cook so I only have a few bites occasionally.

5
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,280
Basically does not move at ordinary times

6
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,960
Brother Zhang Yi now has group stores all over the city.

7
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,320
Why is your home so bright?

8
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,720
And it looks so warm

9
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:17,760
My home is equipped with a blue stove

10
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:19,120
The heating effect is particularly good

11
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:22,170
The room is so hot that I feel uncomfortable

12
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:24,450
Brother Zhang Yi, you are so awesome

13
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:26,610
People especially admire you

14
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:29,210
Can you let me visit you at home?

15
00:00:29,210 --> 00:00:30,690
long time no see you

16
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:32,730
Yuqing really misses you

17
00:00:32,730 --> 00:00:35,110
The weather is so bad

18
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:37,110
Just stay at home honestly

19
00:00:37,110 --> 00:00:38,270
Stop running around

20
00:00:38,270 --> 00:00:41,990
Brother Yun Yi, don’t joke with Yu Qing.

21
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:43,790
You were obviously the best to me before

22
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:45,350
I just want to see you

23
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:47,350
I won't do anything else
